OL,3,GNEWSASeven-vehicle crash closes A38
OL,4,Aeastbound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crash involving seven vehicles has
OL,7,Fclosed one side of the A38 in Devon and
OL,8,Fcaused major delays on roads
OL,9,Fapproaching the Tamar Bridge.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to the crash near St Budeaux,
OL,13,FPlymouth, at around 06:35 GMT on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the eastbound
OL,17,Fcarriageway was shut between A388
OL,18,FCarkeel and A3064 Plymouth with delays
OL,19,Fof 15 minutes and traffic caught in two
OL,20,Fmiles (3.2km) of congestion on the
OL,21,Fapproach.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
